codex
The core threshold is comfortably above the configured normal retry envelope, but I’m checking the exact envelope carefully: there are four total attempts, the function’s own wait budget is 25 minutes, and Scheduler backoffs occur between attempts. I’m also distinguishing “safe under the declared retry policy” from an absolute guarantee about arbitrarily delayed Scheduler delivery.
